    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d515">

                <pb facs="1109" n="1013" xml:id="pg1013"/>

                <head>No. 482.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Comanos to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Agency and Consulate-General of the United States in
                                Egypt</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Cairo</hi></placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1879-08-08"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 8, 1879</date>. (Received September 8.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 327.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatch No. 324, of the
                    16th of July last, I have the honor to inclose herewith translation of the
                    telegram sent by Tewfik Pasha in reply to the one received from the Grand Vizier
                    of Turkey.</p>
                <p>The firman for the new Khedive is expected to arrive at Alexandria next Sunday,
                    and will be publicly read at the Cairo citadel.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>N. D. COMANOS.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d515-a1.xml" xpointer="d515-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
